(5089044, 741547, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your file size is much smaller than it could have been. You may have lost some detail due to JPEG compression. Always use the largest file size you can that is within challenge limits.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, this is really good. I''m curious if you found this doll in the field or if it was a setup shot.</td>', 'Your file size is much smaller than it could have been. You may have lost some detail due to JPEG compression. Always use the largest file size you can that is within challenge limits. Aside from that, this is really good. I''m curious if you found this doll in the field or if it was a setup shot.', '2008-11-28 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089048, 741622, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice midair catch. Watch your JPEG compression when you save. Your filesize is only 54k and there are some noticeable compression artifacts around edges, especially in the sky around his right arm. White balance may be a touch on the cool side.</td>', 'Nice midair catch. Watch your JPEG compression when you save. Your filesize is only 54k and there are some noticeable compression artifacts around edges, especially in the sky around his right arm. White balance may be a touch on the cool side.', '2008-11-28 19:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
