(5089657, 741931, 83313, '<td valign="top">Morgon stood patiently at the door, waiting for a response from the metal guard droid outside the place entrance. The droid ignored him and simply stayed at it''s post, holding out it''s arms in what was clearly a formal stance. Morgon had come bearing an offer of of a strategic alliance for the earlthlets, but had only been insulted with by this display of disdain. He would <b>NOT</b> be treated this way! He struck the guard droid as hard as he could, severely damaging its gyroscopic controls. He turned from the entrance. The palace militia would surely be alerted immediately. He jumped into his skivglider to return and warn his commanders that the earthlets would not be an ally. If a race was not an ally, then they could only be an enemy. The raster canons were already being readied and the new enemy would be eliminated within the hour.</td>', 'Morgon stood patiently at the door, waiting for a response from the metal guard droid outside the place entrance. The droid ignored him and simply stayed at it''s post, holding out it''s arms in what was clearly a formal stance. Morgon had come bearing an offer of of a strategic alliance for the earlthlets, but had only been insulted with by this display of disdain. He would NOT be treated this way! He struck the guard droid as hard as he could, severely damaging its gyroscopic controls. He turned from the entrance. The palace militia would surely be alerted immediately. He jumped into his skivglider to return and warn his commanders that the earthlets would not be an ally. If a race was not an ally, then they could only be an enemy. The raster canons were already being readied and the new enemy would be eliminated within the hour.', '2008-11-29 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089672, 740690, 83313, '<td valign="top">This must represent a pulse. A cool looking abstract that will probably score pretty low, however I like it. The abstract approach says <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=94403" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lpatrick</a>, though the subject suggests this is also likely to be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> entry.</td>', 'This must represent a pulse. A cool looking abstract that will probably score pretty low, however I like it. The abstract approach says  Lpatrick, though the subject suggests this is also likely to be a  Bear_Music entry.', '2008-11-29 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089676, 742158, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice shades.</td>', 'Nice shades.', '2008-11-29 01:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089678, 741894, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little oversharpened, but otherwise a nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Maybe a little oversharpened, but otherwise a nice use of negative space.', '2008-11-29 01:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089690, 741676, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however I''m afraid the execution need some work. No doubt others will tell you the image should have used the full 640 pixels allowed on at least one side. White balance also seems to be a bit off and is giving a slight yellow cast to this image. Taking the WB adjustments a little cooler will help that.<br/> <br/>The biggest problem, however, is that it seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 27k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'I like the concept, however I''m afraid the execution need some work. No doubt others will tell you the image should have used the full 640 pixels allowed on at least one side. White balance also seems to be a bit off and is giving a slight yellow cast to this image. Taking the WB adjustments a little cooler will help that. The biggest problem, however, is that it seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 27k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2008-11-29 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089698, 741799, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, this is an interesting macro. Clearly a photo of opportunity, if it was staged you would have cleaned the bulb first. A good part of the photographers eye is recognizing that interesting shot when it presents itself. Good job here.</td>', 'Well, this is an interesting macro. Clearly a photo of opportunity, if it was staged you would have cleaned the bulb first. A good part of the photographers eye is recognizing that interesting shot when it presents itself. Good job here.', '2008-11-29 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089705, 741192, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems oversharpened, but without a lot of clear detail. I want to temper that hard comment, as I know these things can be difficult to do. I have not done any drop shots myself yet.</td>', 'Seems oversharpened, but without a lot of clear detail. I want to temper that hard comment, as I know these things can be difficult to do. I have not done any drop shots myself yet.', '2008-11-29 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
