(5090395, 740690, 38411, '<td valign="top">"Huh?" was my first gut response, but what I mean is this image is too abstract for the challenge.  All photography is an abstraction at some level but it is the photographic elements that gives the image direction and meaning in the viewers mind.  The abstract portions are were the viewer interprets and derives there own meaning from the image.  This image is gives me very little to no photographic content to guide my interpretation thus Im free to interpret it anyway my mind sees fit.  It looks to me like a frequency histogram of some data set with the DC response to the left and high frequency response to the right and this seem out side the challenge frame work.</td>', '"Huh?" was my first gut response, but what I mean is this image is too abstract for the challenge.  All photography is an abstraction at some level but it is the photographic elements that gives the image direction and meaning in the viewers mind.  The abstract portions are were the viewer interprets and derives there own meaning from the image.  This image is gives me very little to no photographic content to guide my interpretation thus Im free to interpret it anyway my mind sees fit.  It looks to me like a frequency histogram of some data set with the DC response to the left and high frequency response to the right and this seem out side the challenge frame work.', '2008-11-29 13:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
