(5100322, 742016, 59335, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody.  I''m a humble person, but I also believe that this should''ve scored higher :-P<br/> <br/>It was a simple setup.  <br/> <br/>I set the camera to underexpose the ambient light by a stop and a half.  Then I introduced an AB800 camera left (40 degree grid attached) to expose the subject (logan, a.k.a. username kyebosh.)<br/> <br/>He started walking towards the camera, jumped up, and swung his legs way out.<br/> <br/>Thats it :) pretty simple.<br/> <br/>I think I got a lot of low votes b/c people thought that I violated the rules.<br/> <br/>Oh well.  Maybe I''ll ribbon some day.</td>', 'Thanks everybody.  I''m a humble person, but I also believe that this should''ve scored higher :-P It was a simple setup.   I set the camera to underexpose the ambient light by a stop and a half.  Then I introduced an AB800 camera left (40 degree grid attached) to expose the subject (logan, a.k.a. username kyebosh.) He started walking towards the camera, jumped up, and swung his legs way out. Thats it :) pretty simple. I think I got a lot of low votes b/c people thought that I violated the rules. Oh well.  Maybe I''ll ribbon some day.', '2008-12-03 00:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5100328, 741735, 59335, '<td valign="top">Nice Job!  I win this time.  Better luck next time :)</td>', 'Nice Job!  I win this time.  Better luck next time :)', '2008-12-03 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
