(5100501, 741714, 17153, '<td valign="top">Take a picture of something that you could use the statement "That''s hanging on by a thread". <b>Actual thread should not be used</b>.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jtf6agent:</b></div><hr/><i> To the two comments that disagreed with this shot not meeting the challenge... AYFKM??? <br/> <br/>Here let me spell it out for you okay. See the water bag?  See that it''s attached by a cable (cable could also be a string) See that it''s hanging on to the helicopter? Note the word HANGING? If you put these two things together you have something like "Hanging by a Thread" Looks pretty friggin close to me as far as meeting the challenge don''t you think? I really don''t know why I even bother sometimes.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see the comments you two made on more than 2/3 of the shots entered. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Take a picture of something that you could use the statement "That''s hanging on by a thread". Actual thread should not be used. Originally posted by jtf6agent: To the two comments that disagreed with this shot not meeting the challenge... AYFKM???  Here let me spell it out for you okay. See the water bag?  See that it''s attached by a cable (cable could also be a string) See that it''s hanging on to the helicopter? Note the word HANGING? If you put these two things together you have something like "Hanging by a Thread" Looks pretty friggin close to me as far as meeting the challenge don''t you think? I really don''t know why I even bother sometimes. I''d love to see the comments you two made on more than 2/3 of the shots entered. ', '2008-12-03 02:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
