(5101389, 742158, 52115, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> No clue how this relates to challenge theme. Can you spell shoehorn? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He''s hanging on to a, Can you spell L-A-D-D-E-R, by one or two, can you spell F-I-N-G-E-R-S? It''s like hanging on to a ladder by a "single thread". Sometimes a single thread could be a lifeline.<br/> <br/>Yeah, the background sucks and it was hard to show hanging at the end of a ladder in an 8-10 foot living room/studio indoors. It was raining outside. The distracting white spot, I could''ve covered with black duct-tape since erasing objects is not allowed in Basic-Editing.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100207" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IareDoinK</a> a 16-year old prodigy, below has just registered and made zero photos, but 11-comments, started a forum saying someone bought him a game.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: No clue how this relates to challenge theme. Can you spell shoehorn?   He''s hanging on to a, Can you spell L-A-D-D-E-R, by one or two, can you spell F-I-N-G-E-R-S? It''s like hanging on to a ladder by a "single thread". Sometimes a single thread could be a lifeline. Yeah, the background sucks and it was hard to show hanging at the end of a ladder in an 8-10 foot living room/studio indoors. It was raining outside. The distracting white spot, I could''ve covered with black duct-tape since erasing objects is not allowed in Basic-Editing.  IareDoinK a 16-year old prodigy, below has just registered and made zero photos, but 11-comments, started a forum saying someone bought him a game. ', '2008-12-03 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5101396, 741212, 80096, '<td valign="top">That''s very funny about the frog on your head incident. I guess it wanted to get back at you for all you put it through. I heard a funny story about one of those tropical frogs with the suction feet actually jumping and clinging to a girl''s face and she wasn''t particularly fond of frogs either. <br/> <br/>At any rate, it''s a wonderful image and a well deserved first place! Congratulations!</td>', 'That''s very funny about the frog on your head incident. I guess it wanted to get back at you for all you put it through. I heard a funny story about one of those tropical frogs with the suction feet actually jumping and clinging to a girl''s face and she wasn''t particularly fond of frogs either.  At any rate, it''s a wonderful image and a well deserved first place! Congratulations!', '2008-12-03 11:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5101397, 741212, 52549, '<td valign="top">Judi, dear. You''re supposed to kiss frogs (there must be a prince lurking in there somewhere ;-) not let them pee on your head ;-)))<br/>Love your shot, the focus and lighting are a dream</td>', 'Judi, dear. You''re supposed to kiss frogs (there must be a prince lurking in there somewhere ;-) not let them pee on your head ;-)))Love your shot, the focus and lighting are a dream', '2008-12-03 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
