(5101464, 742016, 59335, '<td valign="top">Oh ok.  Let me explain a bit more.  That metal thing on the right side of the screen is a big spherical sculpture.  He is holding onto that.  And yes, it was shot using a fisheye.</td>', 'Oh ok.  Let me explain a bit more.  That metal thing on the right side of the screen is a big spherical sculpture.  He is holding onto that.  And yes, it was shot using a fisheye.', '2008-12-03 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 0),
