(5101469, 741534, 33535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kaleighdon:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pixelstate:</b></div><hr/><i> WOW. This is a great shot. Not sure how close it fits the challenge but it is expertly executed. 8 </i></td></tr></table><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kazzar:</b></div><hr/><i>Very clever idea...well executed </i></td></tr></table><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i>VERY powerful image. Great concept and execution.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I noticed some of the comments were quite fitting and ironically funny. <br/> <br/>Although I do not find the holocaust to be funny, I just have a great love of puns. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>what makes you think this shot stood in any connection to holocaust (not implying he wasn''t but he doesn''t mention it anywhere and from my point of view i can''t see the connection so i''m just interested understanding your thoughts)?<br/> <br/>great shot btw, paolo!</td>', 'Originally posted by Kaleighdon: Originally posted by Pixelstate: WOW. This is a great shot. Not sure how close it fits the challenge but it is expertly executed. 8 Originally posted by Kazzar:Very clever idea...well executed Originally posted by tanguera:VERY powerful image. Great concept and execution.  I noticed some of the comments were quite fitting and ironically funny.  Although I do not find the holocaust to be funny, I just have a great love of puns.   what makes you think this shot stood in any connection to holocaust (not implying he wasn''t but he doesn''t mention it anywhere and from my point of view i can''t see the connection so i''m just interested understanding your thoughts)? great shot btw, paolo!', '2008-12-03 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
