(5101718, 741735, 20608, '<td valign="top">I''m glad YOU will be the one sticking around here and the other ''person'' wont be. DPC already feels a better place. I been here years. keep at it.</td>', 'I''m glad YOU will be the one sticking around here and the other ''person'' wont be. DPC already feels a better place. I been here years. keep at it.', '2008-12-03 12:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5101770, 741735, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think that without the title, one is not going to immediately get the connection to the theme.  With the title, I do love the thinking here that a flower could be sad, and maybe at wit''s end, and is shedding a tear to express grief.  Gorgeous capture of the full droplet before it rolls off the petal.</td>', 'I think that without the title, one is not going to immediately get the connection to the theme.  With the title, I do love the thinking here that a flower could be sad, and maybe at wit''s end, and is shedding a tear to express grief.  Gorgeous capture of the full droplet before it rolls off the petal.', '2008-12-03 13:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5101911, 741212, 88687, '<td valign="top">Great photo and great story too!</td>', 'Great photo and great story too!', '2008-12-03 13:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5101998, 741212, 51793, '<td valign="top">Judi this is almost the same idea that was in my head when I came up with this challenge. I didn''t get a chance to shoot for it but I''m not only glad to see you with another ribbon but I''m also glad that the idea I had won as well. What a great shot and an awesome score. Congrats.</td>', 'Judi this is almost the same idea that was in my head when I came up with this challenge. I didn''t get a chance to shoot for it but I''m not only glad to see you with another ribbon but I''m also glad that the idea I had won as well. What a great shot and an awesome score. Congrats.', '2008-12-03 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
