(5112740, 741212, 89230, '<td valign="top">I wonder, did the frog win, or did gravity? Either way, one thing is certain: the other frogs found it frighteningly non-disturbing that their friend was about to fall to their death. I mean, seriously, they aren''t even trying to help their friend from falling to his death! And YOU, YOU put them in this position! How dare you!? Now they will all be traumatized and have nightmares FOREVER!<br/> <br/>Congratulations. A fantastic photo.</td>', 'I wonder, did the frog win, or did gravity? Either way, one thing is certain: the other frogs found it frighteningly non-disturbing that their friend was about to fall to their death. I mean, seriously, they aren''t even trying to help their friend from falling to his death! And YOU, YOU put them in this position! How dare you!? Now they will all be traumatized and have nightmares FOREVER! Congratulations. A fantastic photo.', '2008-12-06 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
